From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] evr: Report windowed mode from the presenter's GetFullscreen.

IMFVideoDisplayControl::GetFullscreen of the presenter reports windowed
mode: the presenter never enters full-screen mode (SetFullscreen is not
supported), so the video is always drawn in the application's window.
E_POINTER for a NULL argument.

Gate: test/evr-fullscreen-gate.sh (64/32).
---
 dlls/evr/presenter.c | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/evr/presenter.c b/dlls/evr/presenter.c
index 20f35ec..19af041 100644
--- a/dlls/evr/presenter.c
+++ b/dlls/evr/presenter.c
@@ -1794,11 +1794,19 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI video_presenter_control_SetFullscreen(IMFVideoDisplayContr
     return E_NOTIMPL;
 }
 
+/* The presenter never enters full-screen mode (SetFullscreen is not supported),
+ * so it always draws in the application's window. */
 static HRESULT WINAPI video_presenter_control_GetFullscreen(IMFVideoDisplayControl *iface, BOOL *fullscreen)
 {
     TRACE("%p, %p.\n", iface, fullscreen);
 
+    if (!fullscreen)
+        return E_POINTER;
+#ifdef SG_MUTANT_EVR_FULLSCREEN_NOTIMPL
     return E_NOTIMPL;
+#endif
+    *fullscreen = FALSE;
+    return S_OK;
 }
 
 static const IMFVideoDisplayControlVtbl video_presenter_control_vtbl =
